{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34354","headline":"奉和袭美吴中言情见寄次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美吴中言情见寄次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菰烟芦雪是侬乡，钓线随身好坐忘。\n徒爱右军遗点画，闲披左氏得膏盲。\n无因月殿闻移屧，秖有风汀去采香。\n莫问江边渔艇子，玉皇看赐羽衣裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}